  "body": "Vacant and available for immediate possession, this is an opportunity well worth exploring!\r\n\r\nFirst-home buyers, renovators, builders and anyone looking for a property with potential - this one deserves your attention!\r\n\r\nHeld within the same family for nearly 20 years, this classic 1970s home is now ready for its next chapter. Offering four bedrooms, two bathrooms, a generous section and plenty of off-street parking, there's plenty here to get excited about.\r\n\r\nComfortable and perfectly liveable as it is, there's fantastic scope to modernise, add value and put your own stamp on it. Whether you're looking to move straight in and improve over time or roll up your sleeves and transform the property, the possibilities are exciting.\r\n\r\nPositioned in a popular Torbay location, with schools, shopping and everyday amenities close by, this is a fantastic opportunity to secure a family home with room to grow.\r\n\r\nIgnore the CV of $1,075,000 \r\n\r\nAfter nearly two decades of family ownership, it's time for someone new to make this home their own. With the property vacant and immediate possession available, now is the time to act.\r\n\r\nDon't delay - call to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our advertised open homes.\r\n\r\nAuction at 12pm on Thursday 26th November, in rooms at Harcourts Takapuna, 128 Hurstmere Road (unless sold prior).\r\n\r\nTo view/download property files please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/KTWV\r\n\r\nAgent Conjunctionals Welcome!",
