    "methodology": "Primary range is the Homes.co.nz AVM shown on the Trade Me listing. The independent comparable model weights nearby sold prices by distance, recency and property type, and normalises by council CV. When neither is available, a calibrated hedonic fallback is used and labelled. The hedonic model is trained on listings with a Homes AVM and validated with 5-fold cross-validation; it is a fallback/cross-check, not a valuation."
  }
}
